<title>GERMANY: Deutz 4mo sales rise 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Deutz 4mo sales rise 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German machinery maker Deutz AG said on Tuesday its sales in the first four months of 1997 rose to 858 million marks, up 17 percent from a year earlier.</p>
<p>Incoming orders in the four months were 901 million marks, down from 999 million marks in the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
